.pio
.DS_Store

# Local WiFi credentials for examples that need real credentials to build/test locally
# outside the browser flasher's own patching step (webJPEG-CYD, webRAW-CYD, webRAW) -
# see any of those examples' wifi_credentials.h.example for the format.
wifi_credentials.h

# ESP-IDF (examples/webH264's [env:webH264]) build/dependency artifacts.
# sdkconfig.defaults is the checked-in seed config; sdkconfig.<env> is generated
# from it plus ESP-IDF's own defaults on every build. dependencies.lock (IDF
# Component Manager) is intentionally kept for reproducible esp_h264 resolution.
sdkconfig.*
!sdkconfig.defaults
managed_components/
.vscode/.browse.c_cpp.db*
.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
.vscode/launch.json
.vscode
*.pyc
build
script
platformio.ini.self
Test
Wrist*
Butt*
*loacl